  "baselineIdentityObservation": "tenant/work-item-assignments/v5(programId,workItemId); expectedRevision protects per-item mutation and physical append. AssignTo/Escalate receive no request identity, so exact successful replay is stale/conflict; history import only empty target.",
  "identityContractRule": "Existing published owner identity/IdFor remains stable. Required typed creation/operation identity and tenant/program/source scope come from the selected signature/protocol references; no context.RequestId minting fallback or guessed new stream key.",
  "adoptedArchitectureDecisions": [],
  "selectedIdentityClarification": "Tenant / work-item-assignments / existing UUIDv5 of ProgramId and WorkItemId. Selected CommandId binds original actor, exact source work identity and assignment episode; imported ledger history is read-only provenance.",
  "selectedIdentitySummary": "Tenant / work-item-assignments / existing UUIDv5 of ProgramId and WorkItemId. Selected CommandId binds original actor, exact source work identity and assignment episode; imported ledger history is read-only provenance.",
